# Frontend RTL & Typing Rules

- RTL Logical Properties:
  - Margins: `ms-*` (start), `me-*` (end).
  - Padding: `ps-*` (start), `pe-*` (end).
  - Positions: `start-*`, `end-*`.
- Strict TypeScript: No `any` or `@ts-ignore`. Explicitly type all component props and hook returns.